  "body": "I have found many instances of web content calling initEvent with only one parameter.  Matching the current spec makes these pages not work, showing up as unresponsive blank white pages.\r\n\r\nI therefore propose changing this:\r\nvoid initEvent(DOMString type, boolean bubbles, boolean cancelable); // historical\r\nto this:\r\nvoid initEvent(DOMString type, optional boolean bubbles = false, optional boolean cancelable = false); // historical",
